        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, tram track</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, tram track
Material consumption due to tram track renewal are not included. The consumption of these materials are included in the module "tram track". (assumed life span of infrastructure = 15 years);
UUID: e156f77c-40d0-3254-9156-be8f2f385da7
The inventory includes energy consumption for signals. Furthermore, land occupation and transformation are included.
Location: Data refers to average conditions in Switzerland. For de icing activities, a recent Austrian has been applied.
Technology: Swiss state of the art technology
Time period: Tram track length is based on current statistical data (2000).  
Production volume: na
Sampling: national statistics, data  published in literature and expert estimates 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e156f77c-40d0-3254-9156-be8f2f385da7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
